    home: { aboutLink: 'Read my story', aboutSynopsis: 'From the toy keyboard where I learned my first song to the stage of the Lunario, a label of my own, Berklee Valencia and Santo Chilaquil: music, technology and entrepreneurship as one path.', aboutChapters: 'Chapters' },
